    - target: {fileID: 8700019717394828382, guid: 5499c30066df8784bb3b23411d9fa09b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "ABOUT SKILL PROOF VR\n\nSkill Proof VR is an immersive VR platform for demonstrating and assessing practical skills through simulated activities.\n\nSimulations\nElectrical Wiring Installation\nSolar Panel Installation\n\nAssessment\nThe system evaluates:\nAccuracy\nSafety\nErrors\nCompletion time\nScore\n\nSkill Evidence\nUsers receive performance results and feedback based on their completed activities.\n\nEmployer Purpose\nSkill Proof VR provides practical performance evidence that can help employers understand a user's demonstrated skills, performance, and competency in selected practical activities.\n\nTechnology: Unity \u2022 C# \u2022 Meta Quest 2 \u2022 Firebase\nThis is a  prototype and does not replace official certification."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8700019717394828382, guid: 5499c30066df8784bb3b23411d9fa09b, type: 3}
